Description:It is your first main phase. You have Barbed Lightning (choose one: 3 damage to target creature, or 3 damage to target player or planeswalker; entwine {2}) in hand with five red mana floating. The opponent is at 20 life and controls Hill Giant. Destroy the Hill Giant and deal 3 damage to the opponent this turn.
Rule:authored-entwine-both-modes | Paying the entwine cost lets you choose all modes of the modal spell (CR 702.42a): cast Barbed Lightning for {2}{R} plus entwine {2} and both 3-damage modes happen; without entwine only one of the two goals is met
